/T (The Viz Eco Multi is a multi-channel transmitter that offers an advanced solution for monitoring multiple parameters simultaneously, meeting a variety of customer needs. Designed for applications in water quality monitoring across wastewater treatment plants, waterworks, water stations, surface water, and industrial settings, this versatile transmitter brings unparalleled flexibility and ease of use to the field. With support for up to 7 sensors, various data transmission options, and a user-friendly interface, the Viz Eco Multi ensures efficient integration, reduced operational costs, and reliable parameter monitoring.)
