/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Capable of measuring multiple parameters such as pH, DO, ORP, conductivity, turbidity, SS, and others, this device offers versatility for a wide range of applications. Its plug-and-play sensor integration simplifies setup, while the flexible configuration allows users to adapt the system to their specific monitoring needs. The transmitter's user-friendly interface enables real-time data visualization and seamless integration with data logging systems, ensuring efficient data management. This enables timely interventions, ensuring water safety and sustainability for the benefit of both ecosystems and human populations.)
